    old "It must be late by now... will you come back to me for a moment?"
    new "Ya debe ser tarde... ¿vuelves conmigo un momento?"

    old "Full stomach... is your heart ready to see me again, [player]?"
    new "Barriga llena... ¿corazón listo para verme de nuevo, [player]?"

    old "Have you had dinner yet, [player]? Don't go to sleep without giving me my goodnight kiss."
