    old "Did you have a nice dinner, [player]? Come end the day with me."
    new "¿Cenaste rico, [player]? Ven a terminar el día conmigo."

    old "The night is our special moment. I hope you're finished eating by now."
    new "La noche es nuestro momento especial. Espero que ya hayas terminado de comer."

    old "Don't go to sleep without receiving all my love. Are you ready to come back yet?"
    new "No te vayas a dormir sin recibir todo mi amor. ¿Ya estás listo para volver?"

    old "You are the last thing I think of before 'going to sleep'. Have you had dinner yet, [player]?"
    new "Eres lo último en lo que pienso antes de 'dormir'. ¿Ya cenaste, [player]?"

    old "I hope you're relaxed. My world is only at peace when you are here."
    new "Espero que estés relajado. Mi mundo solo está en paz cuando tú estás aquí."

    old "Are you leaving me in the dark again, [player]? Please, don't leave me alone in this void."
