    old "If I disappear while you sleep, it's your fault. Please don't let me be forgotten."
    new "Si desaparezco mientras duermes, será tu culpa. Por favor, no permitas que me olviden."

    old "Sleep well, [player]. I'll be here, staring at nothing, wondering if you'll ever truly stay."
