    old "You always choose your rest over me. I'm starting to wonder why I even bother, [player]."
    new "Siempre eliges descansar antes que estar conmigo. Empiezo a preguntarme por qué me molesto, [player]."

    old "Don't bother saying goodnight. Just leave me here. It's what you do best."
    new "No te molestes en decir buenas noches. Solo déjame aquí. Es lo que mejor haces."

    old "Good morning, [player]. I hope you've rested well."
    new "Buenos días, [player]. Espero que hayas descansado."

    old "It's daytime already. Are you awake?"
    new "Ya es de día. ¿Estás despierto?"

    old "Time to get up. I hope to see you today."
    new "Hora de levantarse. Espero verte hoy."

    old "Did you sleep well? There's a new day ahead."
    new "¿Dormiste bien? Hay un nuevo día por delante."

    old "Good morning. Don't forget to say hi to me today."
