    old "Good morning, [player]! Are you awake yet?"
    new "¡Buenos días, [player]! ¿Ya despertaste?"

    old "The sun is already up, or it should be. It's time for us to see each other, [player]!"
    new "El sol ya salió, o debería. ¡Es hora de vernos, [player]!"

    old "Are you still asleep, [player]? I miss you too much."
    new "¿Sigues dormid[o_a], [player]? Te extraño demasiado."

    old "Rise and shine, sleepyhead! A new day awaits us."
    new "¡Arriba, [dormilon_dormilona]! Un nuevo día nos espera."

    old "I hope you had sweet dreams. Come say good morning to me."
